{"ID":"20240118151039-125h0zi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151039-125h0zi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151039-125h0zi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151039-vbaupbf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143202-z62c8cu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143202-z62c8cu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:170,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:170\u0026#125;","title":"255石灰","type":"doc","updated":"20240202105049"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151039-vbaupbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151039-vbaupbf","updated":"20240122143133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温。治疽，疡，疥瘙，热气，恶疮，癞疾，死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子、息肉。生川谷。一名恶灰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143136-72euca3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143136-72euca3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】近山处皆有之，其石青白色，作窑烧之，则成石灰。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143137-1stfuph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143137-1stfuph"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，有毒 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143139-wee9f2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143139-wee9f2g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】石灰为止血要药，功能蚀恶肉，止吐血，疗金疮，又能解酸类中毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143141-gcl5vvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143141-gcl5vvk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗髓谷疽。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143143-u32o3rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143143-u32o3rw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治病疥，蚀恶肉，止金疮血甚长。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143144-gs6dn0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143144-gs6dn0g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】生肌长肉，吐血，白癜疬疡，瘢疵，痔瘘，瘿赘疣子，妇人粉刺，产后阴不能合，解酒酸，治酒毒，暖水臓，治气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143146-8n1q2e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143146-8n1q2e3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通三分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143147-z9fkq9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143147-z9fkq9q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性燥，且能蚀肉，不可多服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143133-ex63u9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143133-ex63u9m"}},{"ID":"20240122143148-9y2k0jc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143148-9y2k0jc"}},{"ID":"20240122143148-9r38wpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143148-9r38wpf","updated":"20240202104739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第255，石灰。这个石灰呢，一般来说，我们在山边，找到那个青白色的石头，拿出来烤、烘培过、烧过以后，哦，变成白灰，拍下来就是石灰，这是取得的方向。那个石灰【性味】：味辛，性温，有毒，温性的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143157-59wzxx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143157-59wzxx0","updated":"20240202104752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】：石灰是止血的药，我们可以敷作外用…功能蚀腐肉，腐烂的肉。像乳癌，你如果说外面敷点石灰，但石灰又要小心哦，石灰很毒啊，很凶，所以我一般很少用，你用的话加一点点在里面，在其他的粉剂里面。这个石灰非常凶，是止血的要药。你止血可以，速度很快，功能蚀恶肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143202-z62c8cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143202-z62c8cu","updated":"20240202105049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看那个【别录】："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"疗髓骨疽。就是那个骨头的骨，这个字要更正，写错了哦，不是山谷的谷，是骨头的骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那一般来说，我们都是外用，内服的时候剂量很少。不要开的时候说：老师，我们石膏，用二两三两。那你石灰用二两三两？要命了哦。这个没有用，要三分五分，一点点就好了，最多用上一钱。内服的不多，张仲景也没有用内服的，偶尔用作外敷，外敷也是撒一点点在药粉里面而已。"}]}]}